PRO-FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION
WHEREAS it is necessary to establish a limited partnership for the purpose of operating an airline inflight catering kitchen in Alberta, Canada;
BE IT RESOLVED that the initial limited partners hereby subscribe to the limited partnership interests in the proposed limited partnership in accordance with the terms of the limited partnership agreement;
BE IT RESOLVED that the registered office of the limited partnership be adopted at [Insert full address], Alberta, Canada;
BE IT RESOLVED that [Full Name of General Partner], be appointed as the general partner with authority to manage the business and affairs of the limited partnership on behalf of the limited partners;
BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that [Full Name of Authorized Signatory], be appointed as the authorized representative for all statutory filings, regulatory communications, and operational decisions.
